7. LANDMARK & CHARACTER LABELS — ENGLISH CARTOGRAPHIC SCRIPT

Every building, district, ministry, path, and character is labelled with elegant, antique cartographic script. The ink colour varies by sect:

Shadow Sect : Silver‑grey ink with a faint charcoal shadow.

Scarlet Sect : Crimson‑black ink with a faint gold shadow.

Onmyōdō Sect : Pale violet ink with a faint silver shadow.

Demon Sect : Weeping black ink (glossy) with a faint purple shadow.

Neutral (bridges, paths, canyon) : Sepia‑black ink with a faint turquoise shadow.

Full label list (organised by sect):

General (top‑centre) :

Scarlet Shadow – Hidden Canyon of the Four Sects (arched, sepia‑black, 24pt)

Shadow Sect :

Shadow Sect City – The High Citadel of Night (silver‑grey, 18pt)

Moonlit Blade Peak (Leader’s Pagoda) (12pt)

Hayabusa — The Crimson Shadow (10pt, near his figure)

Shadow Dojo (Attack Ministry) (12pt)

Armory of Shadow‑Forged Steel (12pt)

