Basalt cliffs : Charcoal‑black (#1a1a1a), cold slate‑grey (#708090), dark grey (#2f2f2f)

Buildings : Matte black lacquer (#0a0a0a), dark grey stone (#3a3a3a), pale grey for floors (#a0a0a0)

