Kagura’s Floating Sanctuary (West band, 100‑300px, 400‑600px vertically) :

A circular floating platform at (200px, 540px), 80px diameter. It is drawn as a disc of woven silver brushstrokes – overlapping, curved silver lines with a translucent pale blue‑white energy glow (soft radial gradient). The platform hovers 100px above the canyon floor.

Tether rope : A single, frayed rope of braided white hair (thin, twisted silver‑white line) connects the platform to the eastern cliff at (400px, 540px). The rope is 2px thick with tiny twists.

Kagura’s Pavilion : On the platform, a small, open‑air pavilion (30px wide, 20px tall) with a curved, phoenix‑wing roof (raised silver lacquer) supported by four white pillars (thin vertical lines). Inside, a low wooden bench (brown rectangle) with a cushion (pale purple oval).

Kagura — The Onmyouji Master : Seated on the cushion (200px, 525px). Tiny silhouette (4mm tall). Distinguishing features:

Silver‑white hair (tiny pale strokes)

Turquoise kimono (blue‑green wash)

Folded Seimei Umbrella beside her (silver arc with gold ribs)

Facing west (toward the Shadow Sect)

Faint silver aura (soft halo)

