Demon Barracks (West band, 600‑800px, 600‑680px) :

A rough‑hewn cave (700px, 640px) – 60px wide, 40px tall – with iron cages (grey grid lines) and stone sleeping platforms (grey rectangles). 8 tiny demon thrall silhouettes are visible – some sleeping (lying down), some sharpening blades (crouched).

