5.4 Tier 4 – Deep Tunnels (700‑850px, 400‑500m below)

The Maw (Training Pit) (Central, 800‑1000px, 720‑800px) :

A circular arena (900px, 760px) with a 50px diameter – a shallow pit carved into the rock. The floor is stained with dark ichor (black wash). 4 tiny demon thrall silhouettes fight each other with jagged blades (shown mid‑combat).

